## Core Modules
- `src/cpu/mod.rs` — `Cpu<L>` main executor (the Cpu struct lives here, not in a `cpu.rs`)
- `src/cpu/executor.rs` — Instruction execution
- `src/cpu/scheduler.rs` — Task scheduling
- `src/cpu/commands.rs` — CPU command handlers
- `src/cpu/instructions.rs` — Instruction definitions
- `src/cpu/interfaces.rs` — CPU interfaces
- `src/cpu/interrupts.rs` — Interrupt handling
- `src/cpu/state.rs` — AgentState
- `src/cpu/workflow_executor.rs` — Workflow execution
- `src/hy_evo/` — Evolutionary engine (genome, workflow, mutation, crossover, scoring, reflection, integration)

## Responsibilities
- Route messages from Bus
- Execute skills, tools, and LLM calls
- Run autonomous maintenance via Cron

